<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Application Submitted - MCCC</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
    <!-- Google Fonts - Open Sans -->
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bs-primary: #2b4593 !important; /* Change to your preferred color */
        --bs-primary-rgb: 255, 102, 0 !important; /* RGB equivalent */
      }

      /* Ensure Bootstrap buttons and text use the new primary color */
      .btn-primary {
        background-color: var(--bs-primary) !important;
        border-color: var(--bs-primary) !important;
      }
      body {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        font-family: "Open Sans", sans-serif !important;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        height: 100vh;
      }
      .card {
        max-width: 600px;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        text-align: center;
        background: #fff;
      }
      .logo {
        max-width: 150px;
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto 15px;
      }
      .thank-you {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #333;
      }
      .financial-details {
        background-color: #eef5ff;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-top: 15px;
        text-align: left;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <img src="/images/mccc-reg-logo.png" alt="MCCC Logo" class="logo" />
      <h4 class="mb-3">Application Submitted</h4>
      <p class="thank-you">
        <strong>Application No:</strong> <%= rollNumber %>
      </p>
      <p class="thank-you">Thank you, <%= firstName %>!</p>
      <p>
        We've received your application and it is now subject to further
        processing and verification.
      </p>

      <div class="financial-details">
        <h5>Financial Obligations for Regular Membership</h5>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>₱500</strong> - Membership Fee</li>
          <li><strong>₱500</strong> - Initial Savings Deposit</li>
          <li><strong>₱3,000</strong> - Share Capital (30 shares)</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Total Required: ₱4,000</strong></p>
        <p>Membership fees to be deposited directly to:</p>
        <p>
          Security Bank Account <strong>00000 52287279</strong> <br />Account
          Name:
          <strong>Magnificat Central Credit Cooperative</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-3">
        For any inquiries, please contact our support team at
        membership@magnificat.coop
      </p>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
